# Kanbons product rule

Before changing product behavior, read `PHILOSOPHY.md`.

- Warehouse workers and non-technical supply-chain people must understand the UI.
- Do not overengineer pages. One SQL file per table is the database truth; one typed module in `lib/models/` per table is the app truth.
- No OCR, login, or extra workflows unless asked. Keep insert/update in model functions so those workflows can call them later.

After a UI or schema batch, follow `.cursor/skills/kanbons-test/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/kanbons-philosophy/SKILL.md`. Do not ship a philosophy violation.
